WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.120 --> 01:37.960
=Episode 5=

01:38.680 --> 01:39.359
Father,

01:40.239 --> 01:41.159
all these years,

01:42.040 --> 01:43.480
you've run our household
with frugality and diligence.

01:44.359 --> 01:46.200
I've never told you this,

01:46.879 --> 01:48.879
but I loathe leftover cold rice.

01:50.280 --> 01:51.959
Living on leftovers day after day,

01:52.879 --> 01:55.239
a musty, shabby scent
clings to the skin.

01:58.480 --> 02:00.079
That odor never fails to remind me

02:02.879 --> 02:04.680
that I am inferior to others.

02:18.879 --> 02:19.759
Madam Yu.

02:24.000 --> 02:25.840
Mother isn't feeling well,

02:26.319 --> 02:27.840
so she couldn't see you off today.

02:28.120 --> 02:29.800
I hope you'll forgive her.

02:30.199 --> 02:31.319
Once we part today,

02:31.680 --> 02:33.360
who knows when we'll meet again.

02:34.439 --> 02:35.479
Please tell the Old Madam

02:35.879 --> 02:36.960
to take good care of herself.

02:44.960 --> 02:45.639
Master Fan.

02:47.199 --> 02:47.840
Miss Fan.

03:09.199 --> 03:11.039
Be careful with that chest.

03:11.120 --> 03:11.919
Inside is

03:11.919 --> 03:13.039
a rare edition from the previous dynasty

03:13.039 --> 03:14.080
of the Collected Commentaries
on the Four Books.

03:14.439 --> 03:16.039
It's the only surviving copy
in existence.

03:16.400 --> 03:18.199
Its value can't be measured in money.

03:26.560 --> 03:28.039
I suppose there is one good thing.

03:28.879 --> 03:29.800
At least

03:31.080 --> 03:32.159
he's willing to sit the exams
and make a name for himself.

03:33.560 --> 03:34.759
If you succeed in the examinations,

03:36.120 --> 03:37.280
do not fail me.

03:46.919 --> 03:47.800
At least now,

03:49.240 --> 03:50.560
I've finally taken my fate

03:50.560 --> 03:52.000
into my own hands.

03:52.800 --> 03:54.719
I chose a husband
for his family standing,

03:56.439 --> 03:58.159
and he truly cares for me.

04:02.120 --> 04:03.840
She used to live at the mercy of others.

04:04.319 --> 04:06.240
Now she's risen in status,

04:07.400 --> 04:09.520
and sees our family
as her stepping stone.

04:10.599 --> 04:11.400
Madam,

04:11.599 --> 04:13.240
you still don't approve of Miss Fan?

04:14.960 --> 04:16.480
Whether I approve of her or not

04:16.879 --> 04:18.120
hardly matters now.

04:22.560 --> 04:24.319
It's the Ninth Young Lady
I feel sorry for.

04:26.720 --> 04:27.560
Never mind.

04:29.279 --> 04:30.600
What matters most now

04:31.279 --> 04:32.639
is getting to Linchun Town

04:32.639 --> 04:33.680
and finding the Crown Prince.

04:34.959 --> 04:36.920
If Jingxiu can win his favor,

04:38.160 --> 04:39.560
his path ahead

04:40.720 --> 04:41.839
will be much easier.

04:56.760 --> 05:00.960
(My Sworn Sister, Yuwei)

05:28.879 --> 05:29.800
Ninth Young Lady,

05:30.560 --> 05:31.519
open your eyes and see

05:32.279 --> 05:33.720
how people with no family or status

05:34.279 --> 05:35.800
make their way in this world.

05:35.800 --> 05:36.519
Let's go.

05:41.160 --> 05:41.879
Eat it.

05:50.000 --> 05:50.879
Ninth Young Lady,

05:51.439 --> 05:53.199
we're supposed to be refugees right now.

05:53.560 --> 05:54.560
Thanks to you,

05:54.680 --> 05:56.360
we're being chased
by all sorts of people.

05:57.040 --> 05:58.480
I promised your mother,

05:58.720 --> 05:59.839
I'd take you back to the capital.

06:08.120 --> 06:08.879
Mr. Zhao,

06:10.079 --> 06:11.639
could we not go to the capital,

06:11.839 --> 06:13.120
and go to Yongning Prefecture instead?

06:14.920 --> 06:15.480
Why?

06:23.319 --> 06:24.279
If I head to the capital

06:24.279 --> 06:26.199
without clearing things up,

06:26.560 --> 06:28.480
won't I be admitting to adultery?

06:29.639 --> 06:30.759
Zuo Junjie

06:30.959 --> 06:32.519
is going to Yongning Prefecture
for the examinations.

06:32.759 --> 06:33.680
I want to go there

06:34.560 --> 06:36.199
and find a way to have him captured.

06:36.199 --> 06:37.000
I'll have him interrogated

06:37.399 --> 06:38.800
and force him to sign
a written confession.

06:38.800 --> 06:39.920
Then I'll go to the capital

06:39.920 --> 06:40.800
and use it to clear my name.

06:43.240 --> 06:44.680
Quite a plan, Ninth Young Lady.

06:45.399 --> 06:46.639
But let me ask you something.

06:47.800 --> 06:49.639
Who's going to capture him
and interrogate him for you?

06:50.720 --> 06:51.759
And even if you find him,

06:52.040 --> 06:53.040
what exactly are you going to use
to clear your name?

06:55.079 --> 06:55.879
Don't tell me

06:56.079 --> 06:57.040
you're counting on us.

07:02.600 --> 07:03.600
Wake up.

07:06.160 --> 07:06.839
You are no longer

07:06.839 --> 07:08.279
the Ninth Young Lady of the Fu family.

07:18.160 --> 07:19.399
That's what your mother wanted too.

07:36.279 --> 07:37.480
Eat something. Then we leave.

07:39.560 --> 07:40.720
Miss Xie.

07:50.439 --> 07:52.040
When I went to Biyun Nunnery,

07:54.399 --> 07:55.720
I only wanted your money.

07:57.759 --> 07:58.759
I wasn't trying to save you.

07:59.680 --> 08:01.360
And I only promised your mother
I'd take you to the capital

08:03.360 --> 08:04.240
because she paid me.

08:08.439 --> 08:09.720
I'm only doing what I was paid to do.

08:35.279 --> 08:36.440
So, are you coming or not?

08:38.399 --> 08:39.759
If we don't leave now,
it'll be dark soon.

08:41.039 --> 08:42.360
And there are wolves out here.

08:52.200 --> 08:52.799
Wait.

08:53.559 --> 08:54.120
Hold on.

09:20.840 --> 09:21.519
Help!

09:21.840 --> 09:22.480
Please help me!

09:22.679 --> 09:23.519
Help!

09:23.519 --> 09:24.679
Please, sir! Help me!

09:24.679 --> 09:25.240
Help!

09:25.960 --> 09:27.519
- That's the last of our food.
- Give it to me!

09:27.519 --> 09:28.000
Give it to me!

09:28.000 --> 09:28.600
Sir!

09:28.600 --> 09:29.200
Please!

09:29.200 --> 09:30.080
Please help me!

09:30.080 --> 09:30.919
Please, sir!

09:30.919 --> 09:32.600
I'll do anything for you!

09:32.600 --> 09:34.240
I'll be your servant for life!

09:34.240 --> 09:35.480
Please help me!

09:35.480 --> 09:36.440
Please!

09:36.440 --> 09:38.200
I'll do anything you ask!

09:38.200 --> 09:38.600
Sen.

09:38.600 --> 09:39.159
Let go!

09:39.399 --> 09:40.080
No way.

09:40.080 --> 09:40.720
Stay out of this.

09:40.720 --> 09:41.559
Please!

09:41.559 --> 09:42.120
No!

09:43.159 --> 09:43.840
Sir!

09:43.840 --> 09:45.360
- Sir, I'm begging you!
- Let go!

09:45.360 --> 09:46.000
Please!

09:46.000 --> 09:46.960
I'm begging you!

09:46.960 --> 09:47.720
- Please!
- Let go!

09:47.720 --> 09:48.720
Save me!

09:49.279 --> 09:50.399
Please!

09:50.840 --> 09:52.000
Help me!

09:53.279 --> 09:53.840
Food!

09:54.480 --> 09:55.039
Food!

10:00.440 --> 10:01.519
There's food here too!

10:01.679 --> 10:02.759
They've got more food!

10:02.879 --> 10:03.559
Get back!

10:03.559 --> 10:04.159
Go away!

10:04.360 --> 10:05.080
Stay back!

10:05.080 --> 10:05.720
Get away!

10:06.159 --> 10:07.120
Stay back!

10:07.120 --> 10:07.679
Get back!

10:08.080 --> 10:08.720
Go away!

10:10.159 --> 10:11.120
Stop!

10:11.799 --> 10:12.919
The food's on the horse!

10:22.440 --> 10:23.320
Great. Just great.

10:23.480 --> 10:24.320
Thanks to you,

10:24.600 --> 10:25.600
our food is gone,

10:25.600 --> 10:26.600
and so is our money!

10:26.759 --> 10:28.000
Now we're all going hungry!

10:28.440 --> 10:29.960
I was only trying to help her.

10:29.960 --> 10:31.120
Look at the state you're in.

10:31.679 --> 10:32.919
You think you can save others?

10:33.360 --> 10:35.320
You're not some pampered young lady
anymore.

10:35.519 --> 10:36.960
How many times do we have to tell you?

10:37.720 --> 10:38.240
Sen!

10:40.919 --> 10:41.960
Don't do anything so stupid again.

10:42.919 --> 10:43.919
You're hurt.

10:44.919 --> 10:45.559
Let's go!

10:46.399 --> 10:47.879
Cause us any more trouble,

10:47.879 --> 10:48.840
and we'll leave you here.

10:49.000 --> 10:49.759
Without us,

10:49.879 --> 10:51.000
you'll end up just like that woman.

11:02.120 --> 11:02.720
Sir,

11:03.039 --> 11:03.759
we're on horseback.

11:03.759 --> 11:04.799
We can go faster than him.

11:05.279 --> 11:06.200
If we're headed the right way,

11:06.320 --> 11:07.200
we'll catch him.

11:07.279 --> 11:09.000
Keep your blades out of sight.

11:09.519 --> 11:10.279
Don't draw attention.

11:11.000 --> 11:12.559
But the second you spot him,

11:12.879 --> 11:14.639
hack him to pieces.

11:15.240 --> 11:15.720
Yes, sir!

11:15.960 --> 11:16.399
Yes, sir!

11:16.960 --> 11:17.519
Move out!

11:31.759 --> 11:33.360
That shovel must've been filthy.

11:35.000 --> 11:35.840
This is on you.

11:35.840 --> 11:37.039
If you hadn't stuck your nose in,

11:37.519 --> 11:38.799
Mr. Zhao wouldn't have gotten hurt.

11:43.360 --> 11:44.200
You're the quickest.

11:45.240 --> 11:46.440
Head to the nearest town

11:47.399 --> 11:48.639
and pick up some wound salve.

11:48.840 --> 11:49.480
Go. Now.

11:51.360 --> 11:53.240
I remember a temple not far from here.

11:54.039 --> 11:55.000
Puji Temple.

11:56.320 --> 11:57.320
Meet us there.

11:57.840 --> 11:58.360
Go.

13:03.519 --> 13:04.519
Enjoying the view?

13:22.000 --> 13:22.759
I'm sorry.

13:24.960 --> 13:26.320
This is my fault.

13:30.759 --> 13:31.960
Comes with the territory.

13:32.759 --> 13:33.679
No big deal.

13:34.559 --> 13:36.159
I'm wrong if I leave someone to die.

13:38.399 --> 13:39.840
I'm wrong if I save them too.

13:41.200 --> 13:43.080
Once you lose your sense of direction,

13:44.879 --> 13:46.679
every road feels wrong.

13:48.720 --> 13:50.840
If I'm not the Ninth Young Lady
of the Fu family anymore,

13:53.200 --> 13:54.519
then who am I?

13:58.240 --> 13:59.679
Who am I supposed to be?

14:06.360 --> 14:07.240
You know,

14:08.399 --> 14:09.440
truth is,

14:10.240 --> 14:11.159
I'm not Jiuweijiao.

14:15.120 --> 14:17.000
I'm just a salt smuggler.

14:18.720 --> 14:20.519
One time, on a smuggling run,

14:21.720 --> 14:24.080
I got caught in a struggle
between Jiuweijiao and his own men.

14:24.679 --> 14:25.799
What I brought you

14:26.039 --> 14:27.360
is top-grade Ground Snow.

14:27.639 --> 14:28.679
You can't find this stuff anywhere.

14:39.399 --> 14:40.600
You bring the money?

14:45.480 --> 14:46.519
We're rich!

14:47.600 --> 14:48.519
We hit it big this time!

14:48.679 --> 14:49.279
We did it!

14:49.840 --> 14:51.559
Who gave you the nerve

14:51.720 --> 14:53.879
to steal my salt and sell it
behind my back?

14:54.759 --> 14:55.519
Mr. Jiu.

14:55.919 --> 14:56.519
Mr. Jiu.

14:57.000 --> 14:58.559
We've been with you for years.

14:58.840 --> 14:59.720
Please, spare me.

15:00.120 --> 15:02.240
If I don't make an example of you today,

15:02.559 --> 15:03.320
how am I supposed to

15:04.120 --> 15:06.799
keep the rest of my men in line?

15:08.000 --> 15:08.799
Take the money.

15:08.799 --> 15:09.600
It's all yours.

15:10.000 --> 15:10.720
Please, Mr. Jiu,

15:10.720 --> 15:11.759
just let me live!

15:26.080 --> 15:26.519
Go!

15:26.720 --> 15:27.240
Go!

15:27.240 --> 15:27.519
Come on!

15:27.519 --> 15:27.879
Quick!

15:27.960 --> 15:28.919
Move, Sen!

15:29.120 --> 15:29.600
Go!

15:37.879 --> 15:39.840
(Jiuweijiao's men were selling his salt
on the side.)

15:40.080 --> 15:41.240
(We got caught in the fallout.)

15:41.480 --> 15:42.399
(We lost our money)

15:43.000 --> 15:43.960
(and never got the salt.)

15:46.080 --> 15:46.720
Guys!

15:46.720 --> 15:48.200
We're dead either way!

15:48.200 --> 15:49.240
Whoever kills him

15:49.240 --> 15:50.120
and takes his token

15:50.120 --> 15:51.279
becomes the next Jiuweijiao!

15:52.960 --> 15:53.799
Run! Move!

15:54.000 --> 15:54.360
Run!

15:54.360 --> 15:54.919
Give it up.

15:55.120 --> 15:55.879
Give up.

15:55.879 --> 15:56.399
Let's give it up.

15:57.080 --> 15:57.559
Go!

16:00.200 --> 16:00.759
No.

16:00.759 --> 16:01.360
Sen!

16:31.320 --> 16:31.879
Sen.

16:33.159 --> 16:33.679
Sen.

16:37.080 --> 16:37.639
Sen.

16:39.559 --> 16:40.559
Ling.

16:49.799 --> 16:50.519
You okay?

17:06.799 --> 17:07.920
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

17:08.920 --> 17:10.200
Why'd you hit me?

17:10.839 --> 17:11.279
I...

17:14.720 --> 17:15.559
Ling,

17:15.839 --> 17:17.440
people like us don't get many chances.

17:17.519 --> 17:18.640
We scraped together that money.

17:18.640 --> 17:20.599
We've struggled all our lives.

17:20.599 --> 17:22.599
We were counting on this deal

17:22.599 --> 17:24.039
to finally move up in the world
as salt merchants.

17:26.480 --> 17:27.319
The salt

17:28.400 --> 17:29.880
was my future!

17:34.640 --> 17:35.319
You okay?

17:35.880 --> 17:36.519
You okay?

17:36.720 --> 17:37.319
Are you okay?

17:38.559 --> 17:39.880
I knew that amount

17:39.880 --> 17:41.119
couldn't possibly buy Ground Snow.

17:41.599 --> 17:42.119
Come on.

17:43.680 --> 17:44.240
Let's go.

17:45.480 --> 17:46.000
Ling,

17:46.119 --> 17:46.960
we should go.

17:47.079 --> 17:48.480
We're no match for Jiuweijiao.

17:58.359 --> 17:59.279
Jiuweijiao...

18:01.839 --> 18:02.279
Let's go.

18:02.599 --> 18:03.079
Come on.

18:21.960 --> 18:23.160
I had to make sure

18:25.400 --> 18:26.799
my men were fed and taken care of.

18:32.039 --> 18:33.160
That's when

18:33.599 --> 18:35.160
I ended up with this token.

18:37.519 --> 18:39.480
But becoming Jiuweijiao
didn't make my life any easier.

18:39.960 --> 18:41.519
His men want me dead.

18:42.319 --> 18:43.799
The authorities want me behind bars.

18:44.839 --> 18:46.319
And the gangs want nothing
to do with me.

18:47.160 --> 18:48.599
I'd say I've had it pretty rough,

18:49.039 --> 18:50.119
no?

18:51.279 --> 18:52.359
But you know what?

18:52.559 --> 18:53.920
I'll survive.

18:55.400 --> 18:56.799
Are you trying to make me feel better?

18:59.279 --> 19:00.759
People have to keep moving forward.

19:01.079 --> 19:02.839
What you're born into doesn't matter.

19:02.839 --> 19:04.200
What matters is who you make
of yourself.

19:04.200 --> 19:05.599
People can change their places
in this world.

19:06.400 --> 19:07.160
Keep looking!

19:10.839 --> 19:12.440
Your enemies?

19:12.440 --> 19:13.480
Jiuweijiao's.

19:14.839 --> 19:15.400
Over there!

19:16.480 --> 19:17.400
If things go bad...

19:17.799 --> 19:18.599
Check over there!

19:18.599 --> 19:19.400
Use this to protect yourself.

19:22.519 --> 19:23.279
Look everywhere!

19:24.559 --> 19:25.400
Nothing here.

19:25.559 --> 19:26.519
Pull the blade out.

19:27.000 --> 19:28.000
Go for something vital,

19:28.400 --> 19:29.200
and run.

19:29.400 --> 19:29.960
Can you do that?

19:30.559 --> 19:31.640
You two, check over there!

19:32.000 --> 19:32.680
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

19:33.480 --> 19:34.039
I...

19:34.400 --> 19:35.480
I can't.

19:35.759 --> 19:36.559
Yes, you can.

19:37.559 --> 19:38.640
You've got more nerve than you think.

19:41.559 --> 19:42.079
(Search!)

19:42.680 --> 19:43.599
We can't stay here.

19:44.200 --> 19:45.160
We need to get to Puji Temple.

19:46.240 --> 19:47.359
If we run into them,

19:48.000 --> 19:49.200
pretend you've never seen me before.

19:51.240 --> 19:52.440
They don't know your face.

19:54.119 --> 19:55.519
You might make it out alive.

20:01.079 --> 20:01.559
Come on.

20:14.720 --> 20:18.320
(Puji Temple)

20:25.720 --> 20:27.360
(Qin Feiyu, Mo Yi)

20:31.200 --> 20:32.559
Look at how they're dressed.

20:33.200 --> 20:34.440
They're no ordinary travelers.

20:35.200 --> 20:36.200
We're far from home.

20:37.880 --> 20:38.839
Best not to start any trouble.

20:47.720 --> 20:48.160
We...

20:48.480 --> 20:50.279
we're merchants passing through.

20:50.519 --> 20:51.680
We couldn't make it to town
before nightfall.

20:52.599 --> 20:54.119
Would you mind

20:54.119 --> 20:54.759
if we stayed here tonight?

20:59.480 --> 21:00.039
Sure.

21:04.559 --> 21:05.400
Of course.

21:06.000 --> 21:07.079
There are quite a few of us,

21:07.200 --> 21:08.599
and we've settled
in the northwest corner.

21:08.920 --> 21:10.319
You can take the northeast corner.

21:10.599 --> 21:11.640
That way we'll stay
out of each other's way.

21:12.519 --> 21:13.200
Thank you.

22:07.279 --> 22:08.519
Find somewhere to hide. Now.

22:09.720 --> 22:10.319
Be careful.

22:20.440 --> 22:21.519
You seen this man?

22:21.960 --> 22:23.279
He's traveling with a young boy.

22:25.759 --> 22:26.359
What about you?

22:27.039 --> 22:28.160
I'm talking to you!

22:28.160 --> 22:28.880
Watch your mouth!

22:31.599 --> 22:32.359
Sir,

22:32.599 --> 22:33.759
we only just arrived ourselves.

22:34.400 --> 22:35.359
We've never seen the man

22:35.440 --> 22:36.599
you're looking for.

22:39.000 --> 22:39.640
Search the place.

22:56.680 --> 22:57.759
No time to explain.

22:59.359 --> 23:00.039
Sorry about this.

23:10.680 --> 23:11.480
Guys,

23:12.279 --> 23:12.960
here

23:13.359 --> 23:15.920
is a pretty lady all alone.

23:21.039 --> 23:23.319
I know where the man you're after went.

23:23.680 --> 23:25.319
What's in it for me?

23:26.720 --> 23:27.799
What's in it for you?

23:27.799 --> 23:29.279
What do you want?

23:30.000 --> 23:32.359
Can you take me to Yongning Prefecture?
I have family there.

23:35.920 --> 23:36.759
The man you're looking for

23:36.839 --> 23:38.519
carries a pair of fighting staffs.

23:38.920 --> 23:40.119
He's also traveling

23:40.119 --> 23:41.480
with a boy, twelve or thirteen.

23:43.920 --> 23:44.480
Come out!

23:51.240 --> 23:52.640
They seem

23:52.920 --> 23:54.079
to be headed that way.

23:56.880 --> 23:58.319
Whatever you hear,

23:58.559 --> 23:59.519
don't come out.

23:59.720 --> 24:00.759
Stay hidden here.

24:01.279 --> 24:02.480
Sen will come find you.

24:09.200 --> 24:10.279
Do you trust me?

24:11.759 --> 24:13.440
Bring her with us.

24:15.119 --> 24:15.839
Mr. Zhao!

24:23.880 --> 24:25.200
You're pretty handy with that dagger.

24:26.200 --> 24:27.400
Much better than throwing cups.

24:28.599 --> 24:29.400
Thanks.

24:30.920 --> 24:32.440
Now find somewhere safe and stay hidden.

25:15.519 --> 25:16.640
This is

25:17.319 --> 25:19.440
between you and me.

25:19.720 --> 25:20.960
No one else is involved.

25:23.000 --> 25:24.680
If I die here today,

25:25.359 --> 25:26.799
then so be it.

25:27.640 --> 25:29.640
But you leave that lady out of this.

26:13.559 --> 26:14.400
Guys!

26:14.880 --> 26:15.920
Boss says,

26:16.759 --> 26:17.960
dead or alive,

26:17.960 --> 26:19.880
we get paid when we bring him in!

26:21.880 --> 26:22.720
Please!

26:24.440 --> 26:26.119
I beg you! Spare his life!

26:26.119 --> 26:26.559
Move!

26:26.920 --> 26:27.960
Let him go!

26:27.960 --> 26:28.480
Get over here!

26:28.880 --> 26:30.559
I'm begging you!

26:32.599 --> 26:34.000
Don't kill him!

26:58.759 --> 26:59.440
Mr. Zhao.

27:00.039 --> 27:01.279
I was going to stay out of this,

27:01.640 --> 27:02.279
but...

27:02.759 --> 27:03.880
they were getting on my nerves.

27:05.279 --> 27:06.319
What do we do with them?

27:06.839 --> 27:07.920
They seem like decent people.

27:09.440 --> 27:11.319
We were just out on the road

27:12.240 --> 27:13.599
when some enemies came after us.

27:13.960 --> 27:16.079
We're not hardened criminals.

27:16.880 --> 27:18.359
These two stood by each other.

27:18.680 --> 27:20.359
They're nothing like those thugs.

27:21.079 --> 27:21.759
Let's

27:22.160 --> 27:23.160
leave it at that.

27:25.480 --> 27:26.519
Thank you, sir.

27:26.880 --> 27:27.920
Thank you.

27:28.559 --> 27:29.759
Thank you so much.

27:36.480 --> 27:38.319
(Lapis lazuli of this quality)

27:38.640 --> 27:40.119
(is reserved for the imperial family.)

27:40.119 --> 27:42.799
I know who His Majesty sent
as Imperial Envoy.

27:43.920 --> 27:45.200
In this entire realm,

27:45.920 --> 27:47.359
aside from His Majesty,

27:47.880 --> 27:49.480
no one outranks him.

27:50.599 --> 27:51.720
Everyone in this world

27:52.160 --> 27:54.160
is looking for a way up.

28:03.599 --> 28:04.039
Sir,

28:04.400 --> 28:05.440
there's already been fighting here.

28:05.559 --> 28:06.400
It's no longer safe.

28:06.839 --> 28:08.319
We should get to Linchun Town
as soon as possible.

28:15.640 --> 28:16.240
Sir!

28:16.960 --> 28:17.559
Sir, please!

28:18.039 --> 28:19.640
My fiance is too badly hurt to travel.

28:20.119 --> 28:21.480
We're in the middle of nowhere,

28:22.000 --> 28:23.799
with no healer
or herbalist's shop nearby.

28:24.319 --> 28:25.359
I know I'm asking too much,

28:25.559 --> 28:26.839
but please see us through to the end.

28:28.200 --> 28:30.240
Could you take the two of us with you?

28:31.559 --> 28:32.759
Your Highness, our movements
must remain secret.

28:33.000 --> 28:33.960
No one can know where you're going.

28:34.880 --> 28:36.319
Then to make sure they don't talk,

28:37.720 --> 28:39.799
we might as well bring them with us.

28:39.960 --> 28:41.680
Better to keep them
where we can see them.

28:48.559 --> 28:49.400
Get up.

28:53.720 --> 28:54.759
Come take a look!

28:54.759 --> 28:56.400
(Linchun Town)

28:56.400 --> 28:58.960
(Wayfarers' Guidepost)

29:00.279 --> 29:02.440
Food, supplies, wine...

29:02.880 --> 29:04.079
everything they need

29:04.279 --> 29:05.599
must be provided according to protocol.

29:08.640 --> 29:09.440
Madam,

29:09.440 --> 29:11.440
still worried about what gift to give?

29:15.200 --> 29:16.759
His Highness is here
to investigate a case,

29:16.960 --> 29:18.440
and he's known for living simply.

29:19.720 --> 29:21.519
Anything too expensive
would be inappropriate,

29:22.200 --> 29:23.720
but we can't show up empty-handed either

29:24.559 --> 29:27.160
and waste our chance
to make the right connection.

29:29.000 --> 29:30.440
It's a difficult gift to choose.

29:32.359 --> 29:33.079
Madam,

29:34.279 --> 29:35.200
I may have

29:35.200 --> 29:36.480
just the thing.

29:38.039 --> 29:38.599
Go on.

29:39.039 --> 29:41.880
There's that treasured manuscript
in Master Fan Kun's collection,

29:42.480 --> 29:45.119
a rare edition from the previous dynasty

29:45.119 --> 29:46.920
of the Collected Commentaries
on the Four Books.

29:47.799 --> 29:49.720
Among scholars and nobles
in the capital,

29:49.960 --> 29:51.160
it's highly sought after.

29:51.799 --> 29:53.119
A work like that

29:54.119 --> 29:55.160
isn't ostentatiously expensive,

29:55.720 --> 29:57.039
yet money can hardly buy one.

29:59.359 --> 30:00.880
That would be perfect.

30:02.200 --> 30:03.480
It is part of your dowry,

30:03.599 --> 30:05.039
so the Yu family
have no right to ask for it.

30:05.680 --> 30:06.720
But

30:07.359 --> 30:08.920
I can't think of anything more suitable

30:09.039 --> 30:11.240
as a gift for His Highness.

30:11.720 --> 30:12.839
Would you be willing

30:12.839 --> 30:14.000
to give it to the Yu family

30:14.279 --> 30:15.720
and do me this favor?

30:20.920 --> 30:22.599
We're family now.

30:23.160 --> 30:24.559
I was wrong before.

30:24.920 --> 30:26.079
When two people marry,

30:26.519 --> 30:28.559
what matters most
is that they truly want each other.

30:30.160 --> 30:31.920
I'll treat you well from now on.

30:33.119 --> 30:34.119
Thank you, Madam.

30:34.880 --> 30:35.720
I

30:35.960 --> 30:37.079
won't let you down.

30:37.720 --> 30:39.079
(Collected Commentaries
on the Four Books: The Analects)

30:39.079 --> 30:40.559
With Young Master's affection

30:40.559 --> 30:41.720
and Madam's approval,

30:41.799 --> 30:43.200
you won't have to worry

30:43.440 --> 30:44.640
about finding your place
in the Yu family.

30:46.799 --> 30:48.240
(Commentaries on the Four Books)
Being the Yu family's eldest young madam

30:48.680 --> 30:50.559
will carry far more weight
than being some young lady.

30:56.440 --> 30:57.079
Young Master.

30:58.079 --> 30:58.839
(Commentaries on the Four Books)
I heard

30:59.400 --> 31:00.960
you're presenting
His Highness with a rare edition

31:00.960 --> 31:02.119
of the Collected Commentaries
on the Four Books.

31:03.240 --> 31:05.039
Your father devoted
years of his life to it.

31:05.279 --> 31:06.440
Others may not understand its value

31:06.440 --> 31:07.480
and see nothing but an old book.

31:08.400 --> 31:09.839
But you know. How can you give it away?

31:12.480 --> 31:13.480
(Commentaries on the Four Books)
Of course I know

31:13.480 --> 31:14.880
it's my father's life's work.

31:16.039 --> 31:17.319
But your mother asked for it.

31:18.279 --> 31:19.359
If I refuse,

31:20.720 --> 31:22.599
I'll only put you in the middle.

31:23.839 --> 31:24.960
I don't want this book

31:24.960 --> 31:26.200
used to curry favor.

31:27.000 --> 31:28.079
And I certainly don't want my career

31:28.079 --> 31:29.839
bought with my wife's dowry.

31:39.640 --> 31:40.039
You...

31:46.160 --> 31:47.160
What are you doing?

31:47.640 --> 31:48.400
Don't worry.

31:49.839 --> 31:51.039
I only got one volume wet.

31:51.799 --> 31:53.000
We can dry it in the sun

31:53.240 --> 31:54.000
and touch up the damaged text.

31:54.839 --> 31:56.240
It'll still be perfectly fit
for the collection.

32:00.799 --> 32:01.759
You fool.

32:02.400 --> 32:03.799
I'd rather destroy it

32:05.359 --> 32:07.440
than see it used to curry favor

32:08.799 --> 32:09.839
and put you in a difficult position.

32:18.599 --> 32:20.440
Looks like I've found a wife
who truly understands me.

32:22.640 --> 32:23.839
My very own kindred spirit.

32:34.240 --> 32:35.480
(Collected Commentaries
on the Four Books: The Analects)

32:35.480 --> 32:37.279
What a shame
about your father's collection.

32:38.519 --> 32:39.759
What are we going to tell

32:39.880 --> 32:41.039
Madam Yu?

32:42.000 --> 32:43.559
As long as this keeps

32:44.119 --> 32:45.359
Jingxiu's heart

32:45.839 --> 32:47.039
firmly in my hands,

32:47.599 --> 32:49.319
no one will ever push me around again.

32:55.759 --> 32:56.759
What happened?

32:58.519 --> 32:59.799
I failed to take proper care of it.

33:00.400 --> 33:02.839
I only discovered it yesterday
while checking the storeroom.

33:03.119 --> 33:04.759
(Commentaries on the Four Books)
The manuscript was soaked by the rain.

33:05.200 --> 33:06.000
I'm afraid

33:07.200 --> 33:08.680
we can no longer present it
to His Highness.

33:14.759 --> 33:15.720
Then forget it.

33:17.039 --> 33:18.559
I'll find something else.

33:20.720 --> 33:21.640
Take it back.

33:23.599 --> 33:24.319
Yes, Madam.

33:35.400 --> 33:36.920
She doesn't have

33:36.920 --> 33:38.599
the family background

33:38.960 --> 33:40.839
to elevate the Yu family,

33:41.400 --> 33:42.519
nor the wit and skill

33:42.519 --> 33:44.279
to stand by my son

33:44.400 --> 33:45.720
and help him navigate the world.

33:46.680 --> 33:48.000
If she's no use to this family,

33:48.359 --> 33:50.920
why should she get
to be its eldest young madam?

33:53.319 --> 33:56.200
Good thing you had a backup plan, Madam.

33:56.519 --> 33:58.640
Imagine meeting His Highness
empty-handed.

33:59.000 --> 34:01.599
An opportunity like this
could've turned into a disaster.

34:03.440 --> 34:04.920
The Crown Prince.

34:05.480 --> 34:07.559
One man who could change
Jingxiu's entire future.

34:09.679 --> 34:11.760
If this were the Ninth Young Lady,

34:11.920 --> 34:13.880
she'd have thought of a dozen ways
by now

34:13.880 --> 34:15.679
to get His Highness on Jingxiu's side.

34:20.239 --> 34:21.320
His fever's broken.

34:21.639 --> 34:23.159
No need to worry too much, Miss Xie.

34:24.000 --> 34:25.159
Put this salve on the wound,

34:25.639 --> 34:26.840
let him rest for a few days,

34:27.239 --> 34:28.039
and he'll be fine.

34:28.360 --> 34:29.320
Thank you, sir.

34:30.079 --> 34:31.079
Funny coincidence.

34:31.320 --> 34:32.760
You're headed to Linchun Town too.

34:33.320 --> 34:35.519
It's still a long way from here.

34:35.840 --> 34:36.800
You should

34:37.239 --> 34:38.239
eat something before we go.

34:42.599 --> 34:43.519
Take care, sir.

34:51.280 --> 34:51.840
Easy.

34:54.079 --> 34:55.760
Who said we're going to Linchun Town?

35:00.000 --> 35:01.760
You could've told me you were awake.

35:02.960 --> 35:04.119
How's the wound?

35:05.039 --> 35:06.800
I'd heal with or without that salve.

35:09.239 --> 35:10.119
You, on the other hand...

35:11.960 --> 35:12.880
stay away from those people.

35:15.400 --> 35:17.039
Why are you so interested in them?

35:23.480 --> 35:25.320
You might as well tell me the truth.

35:26.239 --> 35:27.079
Otherwise,

35:28.159 --> 35:29.519
your dear fiance here

35:30.320 --> 35:32.000
might say the wrong thing

35:32.280 --> 35:33.320
and blow your whole story.

35:33.480 --> 35:34.559
Then we'd both be in trouble.

35:42.920 --> 35:44.039
Back in Huaying,

35:45.920 --> 35:47.679
Madam Yu told me

35:48.559 --> 35:50.400
an Imperial Envoy was coming
to investigate the salt trade.

35:51.519 --> 35:53.119
Now that we've crossed paths with him,

35:53.400 --> 35:55.079
if I can make it to Linchun Town
with his party

35:55.559 --> 35:56.440
and somehow

35:56.800 --> 35:57.920
help him

35:57.920 --> 35:59.800
with the salt case he's investigating,

36:00.679 --> 36:02.000
maybe he'll be willing

36:02.000 --> 36:02.840
to clear my name in return.

36:02.840 --> 36:04.000
You?

36:05.320 --> 36:06.400
Miss Xie?

36:08.360 --> 36:10.480
What difference does it make

36:10.880 --> 36:11.880
whether I'm a Xie or a Fu?

36:13.119 --> 36:14.239
You're no longer

36:14.239 --> 36:15.559
a young lady of the Fu family.

36:16.039 --> 36:18.159
That means no family name,
no money, no connections.

36:19.840 --> 36:21.000
You have no standing,

36:21.440 --> 36:22.599
and no one to vouch for you.

36:25.440 --> 36:26.760
Why would anyone believe a word you say?

36:30.360 --> 36:31.320
You're right.

36:34.320 --> 36:35.639
Everything I had before

36:37.719 --> 36:39.360
was handed to me.

36:39.880 --> 36:41.280
So if it's gone,

36:41.480 --> 36:42.679
so be it.

36:43.599 --> 36:45.280
But if I can prove myself

36:45.880 --> 36:47.440
by helping the Envoy
crack this salt case,

36:47.920 --> 36:48.519
maybe

36:49.400 --> 36:51.000
I can earn something

36:51.000 --> 36:52.280
that comes from the court itself.

36:52.840 --> 36:54.320
Then I can turn "Miss Xie"

36:54.480 --> 36:55.559
into a name

36:55.639 --> 36:57.679
that's more than "Ninth Young Lady Fu"
ever was.

36:58.039 --> 36:58.800
Just like you,

36:59.679 --> 37:00.480
Mr. Zhao.

37:00.719 --> 37:02.079
You found that token

37:02.800 --> 37:04.000
and became Jiuweijiao.

37:04.599 --> 37:05.559
It brought danger,

37:06.519 --> 37:07.559
but it also gave you a chance.

37:08.320 --> 37:10.280
That Imperial Envoy

37:10.599 --> 37:12.079
is my token.

37:14.320 --> 37:15.159
You want my help?

37:19.360 --> 37:21.199
What's in it for me?

37:22.440 --> 37:23.840
If this works,

37:25.039 --> 37:26.320
you'll get your share of the credit.

37:27.639 --> 37:29.280
You and Sen could go legit,

37:29.519 --> 37:30.639
start over with a clean name.

37:31.480 --> 37:34.159
No more enemies hunting you down,

37:34.519 --> 37:35.840
no more living

37:35.840 --> 37:37.320
with a knife at your throat every day.

37:41.480 --> 37:42.639
Go legit?

37:43.760 --> 37:46.039
That's a pretty big commitment.

37:47.280 --> 37:49.239
Like buying a courtesan
out of a pleasure house.

37:51.079 --> 37:52.760
Got my whole future planned out already?

38:20.639 --> 38:21.320
Zhao,

38:21.840 --> 38:22.559
what's wrong?

38:23.199 --> 38:24.679
I don't know.

38:25.760 --> 38:27.440
Ever since I woke up this morning,

38:28.400 --> 38:29.519
I've felt like

38:29.760 --> 38:31.159
my chest and back

38:31.559 --> 38:32.880
are burning up from the inside.

38:33.199 --> 38:34.480
You have an open wound.

38:34.599 --> 38:36.400
A fever isn't unusual.

38:36.960 --> 38:38.480
I'm so thirsty.

38:38.880 --> 38:40.480
But I can't stop shivering.

38:41.199 --> 38:42.320
My chest feels tight,

38:42.920 --> 38:44.159
and I'm losing my voice.

38:44.800 --> 38:45.800
What's happening to me?

38:46.000 --> 38:46.800
Sit up. Let me take a look.

38:47.000 --> 38:47.599
Easy.

38:49.880 --> 38:51.039
What is it?

38:59.920 --> 39:00.559
I'm fine.

39:01.400 --> 39:02.159
I'm fine.

39:02.840 --> 39:03.800
I'm just gonna lie back down.

39:11.800 --> 39:13.320
You think he's got the plague?

39:13.639 --> 39:14.440
Looks like it.

39:15.920 --> 39:16.639
Let's go.

39:16.880 --> 39:17.360
Let's get out of here.

39:23.600 --> 39:26.120
(Next Episode)

39:26.880 --> 39:27.480
Mr. Zhao.

39:28.400 --> 39:28.840
That's the man

39:28.840 --> 39:30.519
we fought at the salt shop.

39:32.960 --> 39:34.320
The second he saw me,

39:35.159 --> 39:36.760
he came straight for this token.

39:37.920 --> 39:39.840
I came across a piece of evidence
on the road.

39:40.199 --> 39:41.079
I thought

39:41.159 --> 39:42.440
you might find it interesting.

39:43.599 --> 39:45.199
Something this important...

39:46.400 --> 39:47.840
Where did you get it?

39:48.280 --> 39:49.320
It belongs

39:50.360 --> 39:51.920
to the biggest salt smuggler
in the northwest,

39:53.039 --> 39:54.480
Jiuweijiao.

39:55.480 --> 39:56.880
Give me the token and the man,

39:57.239 --> 39:58.079
and I'll walk away right now.

39:58.360 --> 39:59.559
And if I say no?

40:00.480 --> 40:01.320
Then I guess

40:03.519 --> 40:05.199
we do this the hard way.

40:18.161 --> 40:22.481
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

40:26.081 --> 40:30.441
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

40:32.561 --> 40:37.201
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

40:37.441 --> 40:40.241
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

40:41.401 --> 40:46.041
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

40:49.241 --> 40:56.081
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

40:56.961 --> 41:03.481
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

41:04.441 --> 41:07.881
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

41:08.401 --> 41:12.601
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

41:12.881 --> 41:18.561
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

41:30.681 --> 41:34.561
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

41:38.481 --> 41:42.481
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

41:44.201 --> 41:48.881
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

41:49.201 --> 41:51.881
♪Kept close within my heart♪

41:52.961 --> 41:57.801
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

42:01.321 --> 42:08.241
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

42:09.121 --> 42:15.601
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

42:16.481 --> 42:20.001
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

42:20.441 --> 42:24.801
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

42:25.001 --> 42:30.721
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
